      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings: EPS and revenues miss analyst expectations",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹16.93 (up from ₹14.40 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹9.66b (up 13% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹252.6m (up 18% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 2.6% (in line with 3Q 2025). Revenue missed analyst estimates by 4.3%. Earnings per share (EPS) also missed analyst estimates by 33%. Revenue is forecast to grow 14% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 12% growth forecast for the Packaging industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 8% per year whereas the company’s share price has fallen by 9% per year.",
